Rāvaṇa orders Prahasta to question monkey purpose --- Prahasta asks if Hanumān serves Indra Yama Varuṇa Viṣṇu --- Prahasta warns truth frees and lies kill --- Hanumān denies divine mission and owns monkey birth --- Hanumān admits wrecking grove to gain audience --- Hanumān claims Brahmā boon and Rāma embassy